[h2]Build 0.9.8[/h2]
[h3]Changed[/h3]
[list]
[*][b]Nurse work (from Complex Jobs) is now treated as unskilled.[/b] Feeding, carrying and visiting patients doesn't train Medicine, so the advisor no longer sends your best medics to do it. It goes to lower-scoring colonists first, like hauling and cleaning.
[*]Colonists with a Doctor or Surgeon role are no longer recommended for Nurse work at all, as long as someone else can do it.
[/list]
[list]
[*]Safe to update mid-save.
[/list]
